        "id": 1348424
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-08T12:40:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Current code allows that the consumer deletes all key via forEach.\n\nBut I think that modifying the map in the forEach() is risky. That causes that we may have to review the consumer carefully if it changes the map. I would like to not allow the consumer modify the map in docstring. Thought?\n\nBy the way, here is an example for how does the deletion work. The hint is that getNextMapKey () returns the first key if key is not found. See L.207.\n- iteration#1: getNextKey(null) returns the first key because null key is not found\n- iteration#2 (and so on) : getNextKey(deleted key) returns the first key because deleted key is not found\n\nSteps of deletion in forEach:\niteration#1 - getNextKey(null) returns K1 (first key) --\u003e delete K1\niteration#2 - getNextKey(K1 \u003cnot exist\u003e) returns K2 (first key) --\u003e delete K2\niteration#3 - getNextKey(K2 \u003cnot exist\u003e) returns K3 (first key) --\u003e delete K3\n..\n\nFrom the iteration#2, getNextKey() always can\u0027t find the deleted key, it always returns the first key until all keys are deleted (no more first key).\n\nTest code:\nThe map has 3 keys. Use forEach + deleteEntry to delete all keys\n\n@Test\npublic void testIterateDeletion() throws Exception {\n    try (BpfMap\u003cTetherIngressKey, TetherIngressValue\u003e bpfMap \u003d getTestMap()) {\n        for (int i \u003d 0; i \u003c mTestData.size(); i++) {\n            bpfMap.insertEntry(mTestData.keyAt(i), mTestData.valueAt(i));\n        }\n\n        bpfMap.forEach((key, value) -\u003e {\n            try {\n                assertTrue(bpfMap.deleteEntry(key));\n                Log.w(\"BpfMapTest\", \"key: \" + key);\n            } catch (ErrnoException e) {\n                fail(\"e: \" + e);\n            }\n        });\n    }\n}\n\nLog:\n01-07 21:05:27.648 19705 19742 W BpfMapTest: key: iif: 103, neigh: /2001:db8::3\n01-07 21:05:27.649 19705 19742 W BpfMapTest: key: iif: 102, neigh: /2001:db8::2\n01-07 21:05:27.649 19705 19742 W BpfMapTest: key: iif: 101, neigh: /2001:db8::1",
      "parentUuid": "9e0ef2c0_e7642701",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 180,
        "startChar": 98,
        "endLine": 180,
        "endChar": 99
      },
      "revId": "b130a862a5ded162a3a3d1945098eed04b6044af",
